-Oh, my God.

530
00:31:34.312 --> 00:31:36.481
…for his beloved sport

531
00:31:36.565 --> 00:31:40.068
and the commitment he showed to his team.

532
00:31:41.778 --> 00:31:44.531
They're the same passion and commitment

533
00:31:45.115 --> 00:31:48.994
