605
00:37:20.492 --> 00:37:22.160
You got this.

606
00:37:22.244 --> 00:37:23.578
It'll be all right.

607
00:37:23.662 --> 00:37:25.747
Be gentle though, yeah?

608
00:37:27.290 --> 00:37:29.584
Oh, God, he's smiling.
I hate to see him like this.

609
00:37:33.713 --> 00:37:37.676
Rebecca, muchísimas gracias.
I can feel my toes again.

610
00:37:41.888 --> 00:37:44.057
I am so happy we wear the same size.

611
00:37:44.808 --> 00:37:46.560
Good. Me too.

612
00:37:46.643 --> 00:37:47.852
You keep those.

613
00:37:47.936 --> 00:37:50.105
Your generosity knows no boundaries.

614
00:38:08.582 --> 00:38:10.584
Hi, Jamie. Do you want a drink?

615
00:38:11.751 --> 00:38:13.336
Don't really know where to start,
to be honest.

616
00:38:13.420 --> 00:38:15.213
I'm a bit all over the place.

617
00:38:15.797 --> 00:38:17.215
You wanna start with a beer?

618
00:38:18.967 --> 00:38:21.261
No, thank you. Listen, Keeley.

619
00:38:22.929 --> 00:38:25.348
I know that you're with Roy
and that you're happy,

620
00:38:25.432 --> 00:38:28.768
but today's made me realize that
I'd hate myself if I didn't say…

621
00:38:30.812 --> 00:38:34.608
I didn't just come back to Richmond
to get away from my dad.

622
00:38:34.691 --> 00:38:36.985
I also came back 'cause of you.

623
00:38:39.988 --> 00:38:43.992
I finally think that I'm becoming
the best version of myself,

624
00:38:44.075 --> 00:38:46.161
the kind of man
that you always knew that I could be.

625
00:38:48.955 --> 00:38:53.877
And I know that this is
a mad, shitty thing to do, but…

626
00:38:57.130 --> 00:38:59.549
I love you, Keeley.

627
00:39:05.555 --> 00:39:06.640
Sorry.

628
00:39:14.147 --> 00:39:15.357
Oi.

629
00:39:17.192 --> 00:39:20.862
Listen, I was a prick today,
making dumb fucking jokes.

630
00:39:20.946 --> 00:39:23.782
It's, just, death makes me uncomfortable

631
00:39:24.407 --> 00:39:25.825
'cause when my granddad died,

632
00:39:25.909 --> 00:39:30.038
I spent every single night
for a whole year praying

633
00:39:30.121 --> 00:39:33.667
that I could just talk to him just once,
or see him just one more time

634
00:39:33.750 --> 00:39:36.002
like he was Obi-Wan Kenobi or some shit.

635
00:39:36.086 --> 00:39:37.921
And I got fuck all.

636
00:39:39.756 --> 00:39:41.424
But it did make me realize,

637
00:39:42.801 --> 00:39:44.594
we only got this one life,

638
00:39:46.263 --> 00:39:48.056
and I don't wanna waste a second of it.

639
00:39:50.141 --> 00:39:51.268
I love you, Keeley.

640
00:39:52.519 --> 00:39:53.603
I'm sorry.

641
00:40:07.492 --> 00:40:08.493
Sorry.

642
00:40:10.412 --> 00:40:13.957
I've wanted to do this all day,
but I haven't had the chance.

643
00:40:31.641 --> 00:40:32.642
Sam,

644
00:40:33.476 --> 00:40:36.813
you're so kind and loving

645
00:40:36.897 --> 00:40:39.274
and… wise.

646
00:40:42.319 --> 00:40:43.695
-But--
-Oh, no.

647
00:40:44.487 --> 00:40:46.197
I hate big buts, and I cannot lie.

648
00:40:46.698 --> 00:40:50.577
There's just this one issue that--

649
00:40:52.370 --> 00:40:55.123
There's just one thing I can't get past.

650
00:40:55.206 --> 00:40:56.458
What is it?

651
00:40:57.167 --> 00:40:58.293
You're wonderful.

652
00:40:58.793 --> 00:41:00.754
Why is that a bad thing?

653
00:41:00.837 --> 00:41:04.132
Because you could really hurt me.

654
00:41:05.133 --> 00:41:06.760
But you can hurt me too.

655
00:41:07.344 --> 00:41:08.762
Well, doesn't that scare you?

656
00:41:08.845 --> 00:41:10.013
No.

657
00:41:12.098 --> 00:41:13.725
-Does it scare you?
-Yes.

658
00:41:17.646 --> 00:41:20.899
And I think I need to figure out why.

659
00:41:23.818 --> 00:41:24.903
On my own.

660
00:41:31.826 --> 00:41:33.078
I understand.

661
00:41:34.454 --> 00:41:35.747
Take as long as you need.

662
00:41:37.707 --> 00:41:38.708
It's okay.

663
00:41:41.628 --> 00:41:42.837
Thank you.

664
00:41:46.091 --> 00:41:49.427
But, Rebecca,
there's something I should warn you of.

665
00:41:50.053 --> 00:41:51.096
Yes?

666
00:41:51.680 --> 00:41:53.306
I'm only gonna get more wonderful.

667
00:41:56.142 --> 00:41:57.352
I know.

668
00:42:14.411 --> 00:42:17.998
-Food was amazing. Thank you very much.
-Thank you for coming, Thierry.

669
00:42:18.081 --> 00:42:19.082
Yeah.

670
00:42:19.165 --> 00:42:20.875
-Bye, Isaac.
-Thanks, Isaac.

671
00:42:20.959 --> 00:42:22.085
Ladies.

672
00:42:24.504 --> 00:42:25.714
Sorry for your loss, ladies.

673
00:42:25.797 --> 00:42:27.173
Don't be, Ted.

674
00:42:27.257 --> 00:42:28.592
You didn't kill him, did you?

675
00:42:28.675 --> 00:42:29.801
Mum.

676
00:42:29.885 --> 00:42:32.470
Well, I'm sorry that I was late today.
How about that?

677
00:42:32.554 --> 00:42:34.222
Yeah, is everything okay?

678
00:42:34.306 --> 00:42:35.765
Everything? Heck, no. No.

679
00:42:35.849 --> 00:42:37.142
But me? Yeah, I'm doing okay.

680
00:42:37.225 --> 00:42:38.351
-Okay.
-Yeah.

681
