Look. You look like a little boy there.

702
00:44:00.559 --> 00:44:01.893
Well, you cut my hair.

703
00:44:01.977 --> 00:44:03.520
Yeah, I always wanted a boy.

704
00:44:05.188 --> 00:44:07.732
-What else have we got in here?
-Look how long my hair was.

705
00:44:10.360 --> 00:44:12.779
-Home videos.
-I've probably taped over that.

706
00:44:12.862 --> 00:44:14.739
I bloody well hope you haven't.

707
00:44:14.823 --> 00:44:17.367
Look at your cheekbones there. My gosh.

708
00:44:21.246 --> 00:44:22.831
Why am I sitting in a bowl?

709
00:44:23.999 --> 00:44:25.875
No, you made that our pool.

710
00:44:26.877 --> 00:44:28.837
All the other neighborhood kids
who had pools,

711
00:44:28.920 --> 00:44:31.673
they'd come specially over
so they could swim in your bowl.

712
00:44:31.756 --> 00:44:34.509
-It's a good bowl.
-It is.

713
00:44:36.720 --> 00:44:39.014
-You're still my little girl.
-Oh, Mother.

714
00:44:39.097 --> 00:44:40.640
You are my little girl.

715
00:44:51.943 --> 00:44:54.738
I think you had
a bit of a thing for Rick Astley, Mother.

716
00:44:54.821 --> 00:44:57.574
Well, maybe I did.
But that's not him, is it?

717
00:44:57.657 --> 00:44:58.658
Yeah, of course it is.

718
00:45:02.120 --> 00:45:03.371
No, I thought he was Black.

719
00:45:05.373 --> 00:45:06.583
That's Rick Astley?

720
00:45:06.666 --> 00:45:07.667
Yes.

